      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "I agree that 410 Gone might be more appropriate than 404 Not Found for this.  But I'm not sure how much of the federation state is around.  Would be know if a particular path in the former federation space used to exist?  404 Not Found seems safer in that case.  But for the top level of the federation, 410 Gone seems good.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
