  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Once fedora is started with federation configured:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "attrs": {
      "language": "javascript"
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "\"federated-directory\" : {\r\n            \"classname\" : \"org.fcrepo.connector.file.FedoraFileSystemConnector\",\r\n            \"directoryPath\" : \"/mnt/ingested\",\r\n            \"projections\" : [ \"default:/federated => /\" ],\r\n            \"contentBasedSha1\" : \"true\",\r\n            \"readonly\" : false,\r\n            \"extraPropertiesStorage\" : \"none\",\r\n            \"cacheTtlSeconds\" : 5\r\n        }",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "codeBlock"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Then once nodes under the federated node were visited via the browser and then fedora is restarted without the federation configured.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Then visiting: ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "code"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://localhost:8983/fedora/rest/federated/",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": " results in a Java ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "code"
        }
       ],
       "text": "NullPointerExeption",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": " (\"java.lang.NullPointerException at org.modeshape.jcr.JcrSession.node...\") as opposed to a 404 not found.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Visiting any node below the federated node(",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "code"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://localhost:8983/fedora/rest/federated/subfolder",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": ") results in a similar ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "code"
        }
       ],
       "text": "NullPointerException",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": " (java.lang.NullPointerException at org.modeshape.jcr.JcrSession.cachedNode...)* I'm not sure if this is simply because the \".../federated/...\" node isn't available or if fedora kept some extra reference to the subfolder node around too.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "*see attached file(s) for full trace ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "See: ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/issues/980"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/issues/980",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
