      },
      "displayName": "Esmé Cowles",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>I agree that 410 Gone might be more appropriate than 404 Not Found for this.  But I'm not sure how much of the federation state is around.  Would be know if a particular path in the former federation space used to exist?  404 Not Found seems safer in that case.  But for the top level of the federation, 410 Gone seems good.</p>",
